  "thag1.104:0.4": "Thag 1:104 Khitaka ",
  "thag1.104:1.1": "How light my body! ",
  "thag1.104:1.2": "Touched by abundant\nrapture & bliss, ",
  "thag1.104:1.3": "—like a cotton tuft\nborne on the breeze— ",
  "thag1.104:1.4": "it seems to be floating\n—my body! ",
  "thag1.104:1.5": ""
}
